# Leftover balance-analysis working files from the retired investigation
# pipeline. The pipeline is gone, these patterns are not: anything matching is
# pre-publication analysis that names exploits before they are fixed and quotes
# internal game source. Publishing is what makes a finding public, not
# committing it.
dossier*.json
findings*.json
intel*.json
watchlist*.json

